Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so hungry, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, potty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Darling! Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Shido! I wanna eat {\i1}kinako{\i0} bread!\N--Darling, my tummy hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya! Isn't that my candy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph! Don't sweat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you fuss over the small stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it only proves how small-minded you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement. You can part with one or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Hey! Stop eating my snacks already!\N--Why won't you let me eat one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--All right! Everyone just\Ncalm down for a second!\N--Hey! Stop eating my snacks already! --Why won't you let me eat one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Darling! Why won't you listen to me?!\N--Do that again and I'm gonna tell Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi... Why have you done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got it rough, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't keep up all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:01:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm the one who's sorry\Nfor leaving them all in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.96,0:01:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I deployed observation devices\Nto find her, but no response yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll let you know if that changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, why would Natsumi\Ndo something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.77,0:01:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It could have been emergency\Nmeasures she used to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But by hindering the\NSpirit's ability to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,perhaps this is her issuing\Nyou a warning as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise, it could be a grudge against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As far as we've confirmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,there are six Spirits gathered\Naround Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As soon as you're ready, I'll have\Nyou make your move, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.29,0:01:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir. Who shall I start with?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the Spirit from the\NAST's report the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She appeared near Tengu City,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and since she hasn't been\Nconfirmed Lost yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,she's our priority target.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A grand opening amidst the mayhem.\N"My Own Personal Zoo."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Shido is tested as a father figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:55.25,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Four:\N'Transformation'"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--No way!\N--Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess everyone here was spared by Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.81,0:04:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, no! It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.81,0:04:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.77,0:04:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.69,0:04:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Some guests have come\Nhere to see you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you were here, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I told you to behave\Nand stay put in the staff room!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, what have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bother. You're holding us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, do you copy? It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka and the others are\Ngone from the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, they came here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, you need to have a talk\Nwith the Class 2-3 teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't believe that we're Yamai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sigh. These adults can only judge\Nthings by external appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I told you guys\Nto wait at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How come? Isn't it a school day?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Hey, you...\N--What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.53,0:05:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Chiyogami Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for being friends with Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,P-Papa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! It's a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These girls are um... my relative's kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.49,0:05:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just taking care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa is only, um...\NIt's their nickname for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I see... It being you,\NI almost believed they were yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course they aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's all go home, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Toh--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What have you done to me, Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bastard! What did you just do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Eh?!\N--You're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I didn't do...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That light...! Don't tell me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh, he's fleeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.95,0:05:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The house!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The house? What about the house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:57.25,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Lucky"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.87,0:05:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's done it now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, how should I play with them next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You intend to do nothing after\Nwhat Westcott did to us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened makes one thing clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's on a whole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We were foolish to go against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, he deserves every ounce\Nof just retribution we serve him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Retribution, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you suggesting we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.57,0:06:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, Westcott is in\NJapan as we speak, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:43.50,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Stop"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:07:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's so much cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! Shido! Are you okay, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These past few days have been\None thing after another...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:40.85,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"My Own Personal Zoo"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with this outfit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shin, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's gone all out this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But thanks to that, I've tracked\Ndown a reaction from Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.73,0:07:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For real?! Where is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You look so silly! Serves you right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's your own fault for embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Next is to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone's coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.87,0:08:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A friend of Shido's, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Too bad, you won't be\Ncatching me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For being one of Shido's friends,\Nthat was sure an impactful greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to disappoint, but I'm not\Nquite one of Shido's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then perhaps you're with the AST?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not that it matters to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've come to hunt you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? I think you'll find that difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll only know for sure once I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.22,0:09:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're only this confident \Nbecause... of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it makes no difference to me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.95,0:09:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My, my! Thanks for giving\Nme so many goodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.27,0:09:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now to return the favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I must say, you're cuter this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What can you do to me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This fight isn't over just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is more than enough to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! What the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I must have missed your vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But your power is falling rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Help... No... Help me... No... Help...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, it'll soon be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:10:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Why are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gabriel, Rondo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How weak! How weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sneer. How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? We'll patch you up in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You think I'll let that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You might wanna think twice, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your friends are running short.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.37,0:11:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those girls never mattered from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there a bit longer, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.99,0:12:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A useful pawn would come in handy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Simpson...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, at this very moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,do you know how many DEM satellites\Nare in geosynchronous orbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The answer is 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of these, I'm told eight\Nare awaiting disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a minute.\NWhere are you going with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What does that have to do with...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Murdoch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not thinking of...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Let's dispose of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll take those junk satellites...\Nand drop them on Tengu City.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Punishment? Mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All this for my punishment?\NWhat's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was quick, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it true?! Natsumi woke up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a bit ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She took enough damage from Ellen\Nthat she can't use her Angel, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should still be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.27,0:14:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, well... Be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Uh, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Watch it, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you come and rescue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why? Because Ellen had you beat...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I impersonated you and\Nerased all your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When we came across you like that,\Nof course we'd help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's bullshit! Don't think you\Ncan fool me with smooth talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not my intention, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.03,0:14:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you impersonate me\Nand erase my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because, you saw and know\Nmy secret, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your secret, meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That this is... my true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a sec. Why does being\Nseen in that form set you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why, you ask?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.22,0:15:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-When I'm this much of a disgraceful\Nmess, how could I not be mad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi, um--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The first time that we met,\Nyou said that I was pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.03,0:15:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you have had the same\Nreaction if I was like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You probably would've ignored\Nme even if I talked to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.07,0:15:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You would've!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When I'm like this, nobody\Never pays attention to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, I'll never forgive\Nanyone who knows my true form!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means you, so get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's so disappointing\Nabout the current you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.39,0:16:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I told you to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How's Natsumi's mental state?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been up and down, but sealing her\Nis out of the question for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi just doesn't have any\Nconfidence in her current self.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise, she wouldn't\Nbe transforming like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, I think the real\NNatsumi has a charm of her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If only she realized that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'd rather transform than\Nshow her true self, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Transform?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's so disappointing\Nabout the current you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.12,0:17:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who would... be fooled... by that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once I can finally use Haniel again,\NI'm done with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What the--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi! It's a one-day special beauty salon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to Salon de Miku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it? Miku just told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A beauty salon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.69,0:17:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just doing this to make me think\NI'm pretty but laugh behind my--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, just lie down already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're holding up the schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Schedule?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For the rest of today, we'll try to\Nmake you transform as best we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we succeed, it's our win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If there's no difference, we lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:17:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you can do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, do as I please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What if we let you run away\Nto wherever you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.81,0:18:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about time you learn...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that even without an Angel,\Ngirls can still transform.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll start by oiling your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This won't change a...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now we'll warm up your body\Nwith hot stones. How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This will help the swelling in your legs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.17,0:18:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You ought to be taking much\Nbetter care of your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't matter what I do, it won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You fell fast asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Move along to the next room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.90,0:18:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Trust in our skill and behold our work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For beauty, clothes are where it's at!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Step on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.05,0:19:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try on this next!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That brings us here to the\Nfinal room of your transformation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Shiori. I'll be using\Nmakeup to transform you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--That won't change a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Do you really believe that?\N--That won't change a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What if I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that I'm really a man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, look how hurt he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you omit the part about Darling\Nbeing a guy, he's still a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:19:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll use my skills and technique that\Neven you couldn't see through...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.55,0:20:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...to show how I can transform you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How is it, Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.99,0:20:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, why do they all look so happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I did those terrible things...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Losing if I'm cute means I think\NI just lost! Because, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Natsumi! That way is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi! Are you okay, Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Ellen Mathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have I reached Master Sergeant Tobiichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.61,0:21:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellen Mathers...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me get straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Master Sergeant Tobiichi.\NWill you work under me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not aiding an organization\Nthat brings any harm to Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There she is! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you're in quite the predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.93,0:21:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Five years ago, there was\Na certain fire in Tengu City...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.48,0:21:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you do decide to work under me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that information could be released to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You want to avenge your parents, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:22:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I welcome you... to DEM Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.63,0:22:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.35,0:23:41.56,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Five:\N'Despair Comes Crashing Down'"
